IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Mi hanno detto che fare un bagno
con essenza di {{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}
protegge la pelle dal freddo.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Me l'ha detto il fruttivendolo.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Pensi che avesse secondi fini?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Certes le soleil est moins présent en
hiver qu'en été.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Mais là, tout de même...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Il exagère,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
il pourrait se montrer un peu, non ?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Al menos podemos disfrutar del
brillo de la luna y de las estrellas
que la acompañan{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Casi consigo olvidarme del frío...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}¡Casi! Brrrr...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Non è bellissimo il cielo invernale?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Le stelle luccicanti, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}la luna pallida
che si riflette sui corsi d'acqua{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Quasi mi fa dimenticare che
ho il muso tutto congelato!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Kışın gece gökyüzüne bayılmıyor musun? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Parlayan yıldızlar, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}suya vuran solgun ay{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Neredeyse yüzümün donduğunu unutturuyor!
